# XT Scale website with Svelte 5 Component Library

## Project Overview
This project is XT SCALE LLC website. XT Scale is Agentic AI consulting firm showcasing expertise in multi agent RAG systems.
XT SCALE LLC website is built on top of a component library built with Svelte 5, TypeScript, and Storybook. It is important to observe this project from 2 standpoints, reusability - Component Library and XT Scale website itself and its features.

